@startuml
title Data Sources Layer - Class Diagram

class Device {
  +string deviceId
  +string vendor
  +string location
  +sendTrap()
  +sendSyslog()
}

class Trap {
  +string oid
  +string value
  +datetime timestamp
}

class SyslogMessage {
  +string severity
  +string message
  +datetime timestamp
}

class DeviceSimulator {
  +generateTrap()
  +generateSyslog()
}

DeviceSimulator --> Device
Device --> Trap : creates >
Device --> SyslogMessage : creates >
@enduml
